    <string name="privacy_dialog_title">Privacy Policy — Devoirs TN</string>
    <string name="privacy_dialog_body">1. 100% Local Storage: your favorites, completed exams, Bac calculator grades, quiz scores, exam reminders, and progress history are stored exclusively on your device (Room database and local preferences).\n\n2. No Account &amp; No Tracking: the app requires no sign-up, collects no personally identifiable data, and includes zero advertising trackers.\n\n3. Optional AI Tutor: when you intentionally open the AI Tutor on an exercise, only the exercise statement, solution, and your question are securely sent to Gemini via Firebase AI Logic (protected by App Check) to generate the explanation. All other features work offline.\n\n4. Full Control: you may clear AI tutor history, reminders, or all app data at any time from Android settings.</string>
